{"hymn":"S717","parent":"E1281","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Las reuniones que en la tierra","subtitle":"Las reuniones—En resurrección","syl":{"n1":"Las","n2":["reu","i"],"n3":["nio","m"],"n4":["nes","t"],"n5":"que‿en","n6":"la","n7":["tie","i"],"n8":["rra","t"],"n9":["Cris","i"],"n10":["to‿a","m"],"n11":["quí","t"],"n12":["es","i"],"n13":["ta","m"],"n14":["ble","m"],"n15":["ció.","t"],"n16":["Se‿a","i"],"n17":["par","m"],"n18":["ta","m"],"n19":["ban","t"],"n20":"de","n21":["ri","i"],"n22":["tua","m"],"n23":["les,","t"],"n24":["For","i"],"n25":["mas","t"],"n26":"y","n27":"de","n28":["re","i"],"n29":["li","m"],"n30":["gión.","t"],"n31":"La","n32":["re","i"],"n33":["su","m"],"n34":["rrec","m"],"n35":["ción,","t"],"n36":["her","i"],"n37":["ma","m"],"n38":["nos,","t"],"n39":["Se","i"],"n40":["a","t"],"n41":["nues","i"],"n42":["tra","t"],"n43":["rea","i"],"n44":["li","m"],"n45":["dad,","t"],"n46":["Li","i"],"n47":["bre","t"],"n48":"de","n49":["re","i"],"n50":["li","m"],"n51":["gión","t"],"n52":["muer","i"],"n53":["ta,","t"],"n54":"Al","n55":["reu","i"],"n56":["nir","m"],"n57":["nos","t"],"n58":"en","n59":["ver","i"],"n60":["dad.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["El Señor resucitado","Abolió la religión;","Cristo es nuestras ofrendas,","Nuestro templo vivo hoy.","El Señor resucitado,","¡Aleluya! nos libró","De la reiligión caduca,","¡Qué banquete es la reunión!"]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Qué sutil lo religioso","Escondido en nuestro ser;","Danos, Dios, entendimiento","Para este monstruo ver.","Aún somos religiosos,","¡Sana el alma, oh Señor!","Nuestro espíritu avivado","Sea la meta en la reunión."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Las reuniones, las reuniones,","En el monte o junto al mar;","Jesucristo, Jesucristo,","Está aquí, ¿qué más buscar?","Sepultad lo religioso,","Incluso la cristiandad;","Jesucristo, Jesucristo,","¡Él es nuestra realidad!"]}]}